   n = dcount(symbols, @fm)
   for i = 1 to n
      * 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux fca584f (12 Oct 26): - openQM 44 and 519: a matrix that is an ARGUMENT needs no DIM statement; its subscripts say
