      code.value = symbol.var.no     ;* Local variable number
      code.bytes = 2
      gosub emit.multibyte.value

      code.value = commons<3,common.index>    ;* Size
      code.bytes = 2
      gosub emit.multibyte.value

      opcode.byte = len(common.name) ;* Block name length
      * Do we need to set "uninitialised common" flag?
