st.precision:
   * 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 5ed890e (14 Oct 26): openQM item 201: PRECISION INHERIT takes the precision of the program that called this one.  The
   * word is passed to the kernel as the string INHERIT (a number is the precision as before).
   if u.look.ahead.token.string = "INHERIT" then
      gosub get.token
      opcode.string = "INHERIT" ; gosub emit.string.load
      opcode.byte = OP.PRECISION ; gosub emit.simple
