   end

   * 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 0eac1f0 (14 Oct 26): - openQM 418: $MODE PICK.READNEXT, for the READNEXT forms that return an id only
   if bittest(mode, M.PICK.READNEXT) and (opcode = OP.READNEXT or opcode = OP.RDNXPOS) then
      opcode.byte = OP.SETFLAGS  ; gosub emit.simple
