*****************************************************************************
* ST.THROW  -  THROW statement (12 Oct 26 dm, openQM 355)
*
*     THROW exception {, data}
*
* The exception is any expression: its value is the exception name (not case
* sensitive, up to 63 characters). The data, null if left out, is what
* @EXCEPTION.DATA holds in the CATCH clause. Code: EXC, sub-opcode 1.

st.throw:
   gosub exprf
   if look.ahead.token = TKN.COMMA then
      gosub get.token
